    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the Python file that flags or redacts unsafe spans from text using a concrete external provider, I need to choose a service that offers text analysis or content moderation. One such service is the Amazon Comprehend service, which provides natural language processing to extract insights and relationships from text. I",
